 "insight": [
  "In 2005, Luxembourg's fuel imports totaled 1.75 billion euros.",
  "The largest supplier was Belgium, providing 1.04 billion euros or 59.5% of the imports.",
  "Germany and the Netherlands were the second and third largest suppliers, with 147.7 million euros and 124.1 million euros respectively, together making up 75.1% of the top three imports.",
  "A significant portion, 24.5%, of the imports came from undisclosed partners whose identities are confidential.",
  "The data is limited because nearly a quarter of the import value is from undisclosed sources, and values are nominal, not adjusted for price changes."
 ],
